# CODEOWNERS template — safe-harness
#
# Copy this file to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace <your-github-login>
# with your actual GitHub login. See docs/adapting.md.
#
# Human-owned: intent.md and spec.md (owner accepts design).
# Agent-authored with review gate: requirements, trace, constitution,
# arch, AGENTS.md, adapter AGENTS.md, skills, workflows, CODEOWNERS.
# Agents may propose edits but never merge these files (constitution/05),
# except constitution/ as allowed in constitution/03.
#
# Any REQ-ID add, change, or removal needs a human-reviewed PR.

# Human-owned design (intent + spec)
/intent.md              @<your-github-login>
/intent/                @<your-github-login>
/spec.md                @<your-github-login>

# Agent-authored with review gate
/requirements/          @<your-github-login>
/constitution/          @<your-github-login>
/trace/                 @<your-github-login>
/trace/.blocking        @<your-github-login>
/arch/                  @<your-github-login>
/AGENTS.md              @<your-github-login>
/adapters/**/AGENTS.md  @<your-github-login>
/skills/                @<your-github-login>
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @<your-github-login>
/.github/workflows/     @<your-github-login>
